    <string name="settings_product_icons">Product icons on cards</string>
    <string name="help_products_title">🛞 What it makes (products)</string>
    <string name="help_products_body">A stock\'s detail shows the company\'s products with their icons under \"What it makes\" — such as 🛞 Tyres, 🚗 Cars, 💊 Medicines. They were read once from each company\'s About and Key Points on Screener and come with the app, since what a company makes hardly changes; a newly listed company gets its products with the nightly R/S (words that only name customers, like cars in \"tyres for cars\", are not counted). Tap a product to list every company that makes it (within your filters, past the Top limit too); ✕ at the top or Back shows all again. Menu → Settings → \"Product icons on cards\" puts the icons of the 3 main products before the name on every card. Pictures: Microsoft Fluent Emoji (MIT licence). The company\'s logo comes from its Screener page, and where found, its website\'s picture and real product photos (Wikimedia Commons) are kept in the app too — nothing is downloaded to the phone.</string>
    <string name="settings_product_icons_hint">Icons of the company\'s main products before its name, like 🛞 🚗</string>
